<title>BELGIUM: Kredietbank stock div boost capital by 3.26 bln bf.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank stock div boost capital by 3.26 bln bf.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Kredietbank said in a statement on Thursday that 83.5 percent of its shareholders eligible for the stock dividend issue which ended on May 26 had chosen a new share instead of cash.</p>
<p>The issue, at a ratio of 42 coupons for one new share, led to a 3.26 billion franc capital increase, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
